- **Proposed resolution**: Keep marker_step_completed on .completed/step-5c-terminal. Update tests to assert .completed/step-5c alone does not release the guard, and .completed/step-5c-terminal does. Drop the mismatch-fix portion unless the wrapper terminal sentinel is removed intentionally.


